Spec: AuthenticatedServerSettings

Purpose:
  Read explicitly confirmed public server settings for Windows Agent composition.

Owns:
  ./AuthenticatedServerSettings.cs

References:
  ./FrpRuntimeBridge.sdd

Must:
  Require exact schema-one fields, canonical numeric IPv4, distinct valid control/backend ports and a server certificate under the current owner root matching an independently confirmed SPKI.
  Accept at most four canonical distinct IPv4 STUN endpoints and no secret/configuration extensions; perform no routing changes or certificate installation.
